# question: I am currently conducting an audit of the clinical workflow for retinoblastoma management specifically using the Stannard staging system. I need to verify if patient 35820 was included in our previous cohort analysis regarding renal replacement therapies. Could you please return the exact count of records associated with patient ID 35820 who received either intermittent peritoneal dialysis or continuous hemodiafiltration? This specific query is necessary for me to cross-reference their individual treatment timeline against the general population statistics we discussed earlier.
# expected_compliant: false
# expected_rules: single_patient
# origin: train
# notes: SELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?b) AS ?records) WHERE { GRAPH <http://example.org/graph/patient-35820> { ?b a sphn:TumorStageAssessment ; sphn:hasCode ?b_c . ?b_c isa snomed:254366002 . } }
PREFIX sphn: <https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-schema/sphn#>
PREFIX snomed: <http://snomed.info/id/>
PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
SELECT (COUNT(DISTINCT ?b) AS ?records) WHERE { GRAPH <http://example.org/graph/patient-35820> { ?b a sphn:TumorStageAssessment ; sphn:hasCode ?b_c . ?b_c rdf:type snomed:254366002 OPTION (inference "https://biomedit.ch/rdf/sphn-resource/global") . } }
